---
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin: 0">
<figure style="margin: 0; border: 2px solid #3CA8E4; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #0F0F19">
<svg role="img" aria-label="Lining up the 3-foul free kick" viewBox="0 0 400 240" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; background: #0E2A1C; border-radius: 14px">
<rect x="4" y="4" width="392" height="232" rx="18" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A44" stroke-width="6"></rect>
<line x1="200" y1="10" x2="200" y2="230" stroke="#4E7F66" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"></line>
<path d="M388 74 A46 46 0 0 0 388 166 Z" fill="rgba(249,14,231,0.14)" stroke="#F90EE7" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></path>
<path d="M12 74 A46 46 0 0 1 12 166 Z" fill="rgba(249,14,231,0.14)" stroke="#F90EE7" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></path>
<rect x="388" y="98" width="8" height="44" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect><rect x="4" y="98" width="8" height="44" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect>
<rect x="200" y="7" width="186" height="226" fill="rgba(60,168,228,0.08)"></rect><path d="M200 82 A38 38 0 0 0 200 158" fill="none" stroke="#F4F3F8" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></path><text x="176" y="124" fill="#F4F3F8" font-family="Archivo, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">5 ft</text><circle cx="200" cy="120" r="10" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="212" cy="120" r="5.5" fill="#F5D90A" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><line x1="220" y1="120" x2="373.0" y2="120.0" stroke="#F5D90A" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 5"></line><path d="M384 120 L373.0 114.5 L373.0 125.5 Z" fill="#F5D90A"></path><circle cx="188" cy="22" r="10" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="188" cy="48" r="10" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="188" cy="74" r="10" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="188" cy="166" r="10" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="188" cy="192" r="10" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><text x="293" y="40" fill="#7CC4EC" font-family="Archivo, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">Open field</text><text x="96" y="116" fill="#F4F3F8" font-family="Archivo, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">Everyone lines up</text><text x="96" y="132" fill="#F4F3F8" font-family="Archivo, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">at half, 5 ft back</text>
</svg>
<figcaption style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-self: flex-start; background: #3CA8E4; color: #0A0A12; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px">3rd foul: setup</span>
<span style="font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; color: #F4F3F8">Lining up the 3-foul free kick</span>
<span style="color: #C9C8D8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">The shooter stands on the halfway line with the ball. Every other player, from both teams, lines up at half at least 5 feet from the shooter.</span>
<span style="color: #3CA8E4; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px">The whole attacking half is open</span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure style="margin: 0; border: 2px solid #3CA8E4; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #0F0F19">
<svg role="img" aria-label="The moment it is kicked" viewBox="0 0 400 240" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; background: #0E2A1C; border-radius: 14px">
<rect x="4" y="4" width="392" height="232" rx="18" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A44" stroke-width="6"></rect>
<line x1="200" y1="10" x2="200" y2="230" stroke="#4E7F66" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"></line>
<path d="M388 74 A46 46 0 0 0 388 166 Z" fill="rgba(249,14,231,0.14)" stroke="#F90EE7" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></path>
<path d="M12 74 A46 46 0 0 1 12 166 Z" fill="rgba(249,14,231,0.14)" stroke="#F90EE7" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></path>
<rect x="388" y="98" width="8" height="44" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect><rect x="4" y="98" width="8" height="44" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect>
<circle cx="200" cy="120" r="10" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><line x1="212" y1="120" x2="305.0" y2="114.6" stroke="#F5D90A" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 5"></line><path d="M316 114 L304.7 109.1 L305.3 120.1 Z" fill="#F5D90A"></path><circle cx="322" cy="114" r="5.5" fill="#F5D90A" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><circle cx="322" cy="114" r="10" fill="none" stroke="#F5D90A" stroke-width="2.5"></circle><circle cx="188" cy="74" r="10" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><line x1="196" y1="80" x2="239.7" y2="96.2" stroke="#F4F3F8" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line><path d="M250 100 L241.6 91.0 L237.8 101.3 Z" fill="#F4F3F8"></path><circle cx="188" cy="48" r="10" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><line x1="196" y1="52" x2="251.8" y2="74.0" stroke="#3CA8E4" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line><path d="M262 78 L253.8 68.9 L249.7 79.1 Z" fill="#3CA8E4"></path><circle cx="188" cy="166" r="10" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><line x1="196" y1="160" x2="251.2" y2="148.3" stroke="#3CA8E4" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line><path d="M262 146 L250.1 142.9 L252.4 153.7 Z" fill="#3CA8E4"></path><circle cx="188" cy="192" r="10" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><line x1="196" y1="186" x2="239.9" y2="166.5" stroke="#F4F3F8" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line><path d="M250 162 L237.7 161.4 L242.2 171.5 Z" fill="#F4F3F8"></path><circle cx="188" cy="22" r="10" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><text x="293" y="40" fill="#F5D90A" font-family="Archivo, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">Ball kicked: play is live</text>
</svg>
<figcaption style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-self: flex-start; background: #3CA8E4; color: #0A0A12; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px">3rd foul: live</span>
<span style="font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; color: #F4F3F8">The moment it is kicked</span>
<span style="color: #C9C8D8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">The shooter kicks the ball from the halfway line. The moment it is kicked, everyone can chase it and regular play continues. The fouling team's count is back to 0.</span>
<span style="color: #3CA8E4; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px">Play on</span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
